Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:06.40,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I won't fall for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.77,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,You're just a Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:23.58,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Makabe Masamune at his \Nabsolute best yet again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:27.70,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I am truly like the rising sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:30.95,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Yikes, guess you're still full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:32.34,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:36.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Chinatsu! I thought I told you \Nnot to just barge in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:38.51,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever. Man, you're loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:40.60,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Control yourself when you're in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.20,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Don't embarrass all of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HAAD7E6&\bord1\an5\fs12\3c&H395567&\frx22\fay-.43\fax.8\pos(308.667,134)}Class Trip  France
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H314C5E&\bord1\an5\fs8\frx22\fay-.49\fax.8\3c&HA6D3E3&\pos(409.334,206.666)}Yasaka High School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.96,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Good morning, Maa-kun and Chinatsu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:47.10,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,It's time for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.47,0:00:49.04,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,You're leaving today, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:51.61,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,I went all-out for you today!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.61,0:00:54.86,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,There's fried chicken, \Nfried shrimp, and even gratin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(78,42)\c&H4D48DE&\3c&H54F6FE&}High in calories
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(526,290.667)\c&H253430&\3c&H4E8CF4&}High in calories
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:54.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(548,166)\3c&H4E3FD8&}High in calories
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.37,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Yay, gratin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:00:59.58,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Maa-kun, is there anything \Nelse you'd like to ea—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.93,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Both of you, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.59,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Damn that loli hag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:07.98,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,How could I eat something so high \Nin calories first thing in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:13.55,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,The greatest opportunity since the \Ncultural festival has presented itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:16.43,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,The City of Flowers is truly a perfect \Nplace to exact my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:20.79,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,And that's when I'll get a checkmate \Nin my Dead or Love plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.57,0:01:30.57,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:31.57,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:34.97,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Could you take my suitcase, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:36.57,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:48.44,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Get me a gift, 'kay thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:51.75,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Maa-kun, come home soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:52.91,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Maa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.91,0:01:55.64,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:32.98,Episode Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1475,1050)\fsp1.5\pos(600,300)}#1 "{\c&H2E8DE8&}T{\c&H6B47F3&}h{\c&H2E8DE8&}e {\c&H6B47F3&}W{\c&H2E8DE8&}e{\c&H6B47F3&}e {\c&H2E8DE8&}P{\c&H6B47F3&}a{\c&H2E8DE8&}r{\c&H6B47F3&}i{\c&H2E8DE8&}s{\c&H6B47F3&}i{\c&H2E8DE8&}a{\c&H6B47F3&}n {\c&H2E8DE8&}M{\c&H6B47F3&}a{\c&H2E8DE8&}d{\c&H6B47F3&}e{\c&H2E8DE8&}m{\c&H6B47F3&}o{\c&H2E8DE8&}i{\c&H6B47F3&}s{\c&H2E8DE8&}e{\c&H6B47F3&}l{\c&H2E8DE8&}l{\c&H6B47F3&}e"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:38.35,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,Dearest Muriel, I saw the piece you sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.51,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,It's quite a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.11,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,One piece of advice I have for you:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:46.12,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,you should learn more about \NJapanese high school students.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:48.37,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,So it {\i1}is{\i0} hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.37,0:03:50.50,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,No matter how much I practice...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:56.73,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,High school students from Japon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:03:59.83,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,They're just too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:02.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:07.95,Main,Tour guide,0,0,0,,An art museum was made in the \NLouvre Palace during the French Revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:10.64,Main,Tour guide,0,0,0,,It can easily be called the \Ngreatest art museum in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:14.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\b0\3c&HF9FDFA&\c&H8083C0&\frz355.1\pos(210.667,205.333)}Trave{\c&H9C90A1&}ling {\c&H90A7ED&}Thro{\c&HA49296&}ugh {\c&H6E7D7A&}France
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:13.96,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Sans crème s'il vous plait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.72,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,"Without whipped cream, please."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:21.50,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I've never seen Kojuurou \Nstudy so hard in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:23.31,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,What should I do, Makabe-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:26.08,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,We're in the land of macarons, \Ncanelés, and bon bon chocolats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.61,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:29.79,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Try to calm down a bit, Kojuurou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:32.45,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Fashion! The Opera House! Ballet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:36.92,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Love and romance! Amore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.20,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What you're trying to say is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:41.32,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,What you're trying to say \Nis "amour," Futaba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.55,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,"Amore" is Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:00.49,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,So you've come, Cruel Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:03.86,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan, there was a \Nchurros shop over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.11,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,And there's the bumpkin fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:08.50,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,There he goes, getting in my way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:14.48,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, no. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.71,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,For me, this class trip should be—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:27.51,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,We're definitely in the land of amour! \NPDA everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.77,0:05:31.60,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,This country is truly the best place for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:38.46,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm going to make Adagaki Aki fall for me, \Nand then dump her on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:41.57,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,So that I can move my \NDead or Love plan forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:44.19,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Cruel Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:46.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The rising sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:49.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, Soleil le Vant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:50.01,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:50.99,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:54.86,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Could you keep some time open \Nduring our free periods on this trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:57.37,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:59.08,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Exactly what it sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:02.17,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I've been thinking ever \Nsince the cultural festival
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:06.05,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,that I should actually take some \Ntime to properly talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:09.71,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Th-This is... Wait, what the heck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:14.01,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is a promise! \NI'll make you pay if you break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:16.33,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,U-Uh, w-wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no! A French girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.21,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.57,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,H-How do I apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:25.94,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\bord0\pos(370,36)\frz15.72\fax.1}Schedule Book
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:25.94,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\bord0\pos(476.667,307.333)\frz20.66\frx2\fry0}Translation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:29.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Excusez moi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:32.70,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Ca nefaitrien.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:33.96,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,An eyepatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:37.44,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Are you Japonais?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:38.81,Main,Masamune and Aki,0,0,0,,Did she just speak Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:43.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I'm Japanese. I'm in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:46.04,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,A high school student...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.88,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Japanese...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:54.97,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Yes! You're the one I was \Nlooking for, my Chikuwa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:07:01.65,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,My name is Muriel Besson!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:04.41,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I am a second-year in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:06.28,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm Makabe Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:08.33,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm Adagaki Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:11.58,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Your Japanese is very good. \NDid you study it somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:16.32,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Why, yes! I learned a lot from \Nanime and manga from Japon, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:17.91,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Manga, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:21.12,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Manga from Japon is fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:26.63,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Every time my brother goes to Tokyo for work, \NI ask him to buy me lots of manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:28.45,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:30.09,Italics,Aki and Masamune,0,0,0,,...definitely an otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:34.72,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I hope that one day I'll be able \Nto draw manga like that, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wait, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:42.72,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Well, we do have bande dessinée in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:46.57,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,But what I want to draw is \NJaponais manga, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:51.93,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You drew this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.93,0:07:55.11,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Yes! I still have much to work on, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:57.58,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,425)\pos(352,36)\c&H394136&\3c&HF1F5EE&\bord1.5\frz351.7}Leave it to Tsumire
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:12.30,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I want to draw a poppy and exciting rom-com \Nabout Tsumire-san, who lives in Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.28,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Rom-com?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:17.37,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Why in the world are the names of the \Nheroine and hero Tsumire and Chikuwa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:20.77,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Because my favorite Japanese food is oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:27.20,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Does something seem off to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:29.16,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if "off" is the right word...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:31.99,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I do have a lot of questions...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:34.67,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,My older brother also told me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:38.97,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,that I should learn more about \NJapanese high school students.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:43.46,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,When I first saw you, I thought Chikuwa-kun \Nwas standing right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.39,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:47.92,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,You're the ideal Japanese \Nhigh school boy, Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:51.56,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Please let me use you \Nas a model for my manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:52.00,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:52.81,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:56.40,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,What do real high school boys think about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:59.64,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Do you prefer toast for breakfast? \NOr perhaps sushi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.76,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:01.85,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:05.44,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm flattered that you're so interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:07.69,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,but I'm currently on vacation...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.48,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Is there any way you'd consider it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:16.20,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:20.66,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, are you saying you don't care \Nabout your promise with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:23.77,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Muriel-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:26.86,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,We're but humble high school \Nstudents on their class trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:29.13,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Humble?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:31.78,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean like the samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:32.87,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:38.78,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, we have to stay with our class, \Nso we don't have much free time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:43.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,and when I do, I plan to go around with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:46.46,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey! What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:48.52,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Throw me a bone here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:52.72,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So, even though I'd like to help \Nyou out, I just don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:53.98,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:57.29,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:10:00.72,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I cannot force you, I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:03.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'll be rooting for you. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:22.30,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Fujinomiya-san, do you like that painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.84,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes, though I'm not sure if \N"like" is the right word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:27.26,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I just feel uneasy looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.51,0:10:32.25,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Look, they're not wearing anything on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:33.79,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:37.86,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Feeling cold can lead to many ailments. \NI want to lend them something to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:41.19,Italics,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Fujinomiya-san's so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:43.90,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Fujinomiya-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:44.68,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:48.68,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Um, um, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:52.99,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You're looking quite pale \Nyourself, Kojuurou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:55.56,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,No! I'm totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.13,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.99,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What's the matter, you two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:06.94,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Can someone get us some stretchers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:09.66,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Mind your own business, Commando.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:13.15,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I don't want to excite them any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:14.73,Main,Kojuurou; Neko; Tae,0,0,0,,"Them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.12,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,We're safe here, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.95,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:27.27,Main,Masamune and Aki,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.91,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,She sure was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:33.90,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll say that she's definitely passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:39.08,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Anyway, get off of me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.28,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:44.31,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:46.41,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.19,Flashback,Skinhead,0,0,0,,Venez.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:06.46,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Adagaki-san, is your French decent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:08.36,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I can basically say, "Can I get the check,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:11.04,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,and "Is there anyone who understands Japanese?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:13.13,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Good. We're on the same level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:16.01,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Why are you relieved \Nright now?! Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:20.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,M-Marcy bocut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:21.07,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Crowassant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Escargoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:24.97,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Arch of Triumph! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:29.93,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, 3D Chikuwa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.84,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,My name is Frank Besson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:37.15,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,I'm the older brother of the \Ngirl you just rejected, Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:41.98,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,My position is the reverse of yours right now. \NI'm actually in Tokyo on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:44.33,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Japan sure is a nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:48.04,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,B-Business, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:52.87,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,No matter. That's not the \Nissue here. It's what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:55.53,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,Why did you decline Muriel's request?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:57.21,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:13:01.66,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,The worst sin you can commit \Nin this world is making Muriel cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:05.84,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,The second-worst sin you can commit \Nin this world is disappointing Muriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:10.30,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,If you want to stay with that girl there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:14.97,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,how about you two teach Muriel \Nthe essence of a rom-com?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.97,0:13:18.04,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,That's simple enough, isn't it, Chikuwa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:25.64,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Ah... So when you get a day with free time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:29.80,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,you have to spend it with Aki-sama \Nand this otaku mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:33.20,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Can I ask how that happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:35.35,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I honestly have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:44.11,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Everything was ruined despite \Nyou setting it all up for me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:46.13,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Me? What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.76,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:51.89,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I figured the Cruel Princess \Nwouldn't invite me to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:54.17,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,one-on-one without your help...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.35,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:02.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wait, does that mean she invited me herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:05.03,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm honestly surprised myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:10.03,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I should actually take some \Ntime to properly talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:12.31,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,She looked pretty serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:16.81,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But it's a good thing that \NAki-sama seems proactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:18.75,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:23.15,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'll help you out so that \Nno one else gets in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:24.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:34.78,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. Kojuurou and the \Nothers are waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:42.38,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.19,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm seriously counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:15:00.54,Main,Male student,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna be in \Nthe shower? Get out already, Gasou.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:03.88,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Sorry. Just hang on a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:08.55,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Jeez, I can't even get changed \Nin peace. How annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:12.80,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan, there was a churros shop over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:15.00,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Why don't we go there together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.37,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Sorry, I've got something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:20.98,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Makabe Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.98,0:15:23.10,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,You accursed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:25.60,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,I need money, damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:29.23,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,So that I can preserve the Gasou name and status.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:31.63,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Love and gender don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:33.50,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Money is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:37.16,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,I catch a red snapper using a shrimp...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:40.54,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Nay, I'll catch money using love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:45.00,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,I call this brilliant plan... "Fishing."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:52.26,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I guess neither of us got any sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:55.45,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go, Adagaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:56.72,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:59.20,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Are you really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:01.82,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Weren't you threatened \Nby some really scary people?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:04.04,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Want us to tag along quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:06.44,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I think we'll be fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:12.01,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,We're counting on you if we don't \Nmake it back in time, Commando.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:22.43,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Masamune! Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.43,0:16:24.97,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,You actually came, you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:29.07,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I was so excited for today that \NI was tingling with excitement!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:31.00,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Do you mean "trembling with excitement"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:31.72,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Oui!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:37.10,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,She's so serious about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.00,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.44,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.08,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,First, Besson-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.26,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,You can call me Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:48.96,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay, Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:51.36,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,There's something I want to \Nask you about this manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:52.90,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:56.61,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,First, this right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:17:00.70,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,He asked her out three panels ago, \Nand they're totally a thing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.32,0:17:03.42,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Is there a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:09.26,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,As someone who's read all the volumes of \Nthe monumental classic of romance manga,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Rose-eyed Steroid{\i0}," let me say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.12,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,When it comes to rom-coms...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:16.01,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Once they both fall for each other, \N80% of the story is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:19.05,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Tease! Tease until you can tease no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:20.59,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Tease?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:21.58,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.48,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You can make it all count in the remaining 20%,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:28.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,but it's a cruel path that \NI cannot recommend to beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:30.94,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:32.16,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:34.80,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I mean, they like each other, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:36.74,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Then they should tell each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:41.20,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Staring at each other like this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:44.79,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,and kissing might also be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:45.66,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:47.31,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Je t'adore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.53,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:55.31,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Unlike French people, normal Japanese people
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:58.84,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,can't easily tell someone \Nelse their feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:01.72,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,There are times we want to \Nbe honest, but we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:04.84,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Or something from their past \Nmight be holding them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.33,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,A lot can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:08.57,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,So even if you have feelings for each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:10.57,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,there's some reason you can't tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:12.00,Main,Masamune and Aki,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:14.97,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Are you talking about you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:20.51,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,A-A-A-A-A-Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:24.32,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Aki, your Japanese is hard to understand \Nbecause you speak so fast, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:26.79,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm telling you that's inconceivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:29.29,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:32.16,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What you need to learn is \Nthe Japanese form of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:35.07,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You are forbidden from becoming \Nromantically involved with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.07,0:18:36.38,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:38.51,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I understand, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:42.19,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,We'll show you how things are done \Nas characters in a rom-com,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.19,0:18:43.74,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,so make sure you pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:44.27,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:46.98,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm looking forward to this, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:49.62,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Honestly. You're so illogical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:52.30,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Now, then. To show you how it's done...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.92,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,How it's done...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:56.33,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,How do we do that, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.95,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,You didn't think about what to show her, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:08.62,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Japanese romance? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:12.33,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,What should we show her, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.20,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,We hit the jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:17.95,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,What do you think, Fujinomiya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:22.05,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I think Masamune-sama might \Nenjoy this level of sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.76,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:31.95,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Fujinomiya-san, do you \Nstill like Masamune-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:33.48,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:37.82,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Is that a bit too pathetic \Nafter he rejected me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:40.20,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Not at all! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:45.29,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I think about what could've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.29,0:19:47.85,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Perhaps if we had met in \Na slightly different way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:50.46,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Maybe if there wasn't a lie \Ninvolved from the start...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:54.92,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,But if I didn't have that lie, \NI would've been too scared to approach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:59.14,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's going to suffer \Neven more from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:01.42,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:06.59,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm sort of looking forward \Nto that day, but also not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:08.58,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,It's rather complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:13.32,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I can't really understand complicated things,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:17.30,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,b-but since you're so confused \Nby this, Fujinomiya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:22.57,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I think you're very profound!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:27.05,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Kojuurou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:29.04,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,What lovely words of encouragement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:34.10,Italics,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I'm such a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:38.75,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:41.29,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:43.72,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm seeing things...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:46.22,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:53.31,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Hey, is this really the right way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:57.40,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I think we got it right this time. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.35,0:21:02.72,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan wanted to tell me \Nsomething personally, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.84,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I can't keep her waiting, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:07.51,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Sorry. Just a little farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.62,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Until free time is over...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.58,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,You just keep apologizing over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:24.76,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Hey. Are you hiding something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:28.72,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:31.52,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I was actually lying when I said \NAki-sama was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:34.44,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,What? Why would you lie \Nabout something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:40.87,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Because... I wanted to spend as much time \Nwith you as I could, Kanetsugu-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:45.50,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Kanetsugu-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:49.41,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,O-Oh, jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:52.98,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:57.30,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna fall for that anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:03.25,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,you betraying little witch.
